---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import profilePic from '../assets/profile-pic.jpeg';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About"
  description="Rasheed Bustamam is a fractional founding engineer and technical advisor for funded startups, working remotely from California through Bustamam Technology."
  chromePath="/about"
>
  <div class="page-shell pt-12 pb-20 max-w-2xl">
    <div class="mb-7 font-mono text-11 text-mute tracking-[.04em]">
      <a href="/" class="text-mute no-underline">← home</a>
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-serif text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,4rem)] font-medium tracking-[-0.028em] text-ink m-0 mb-10">
      About.
    </h1>

    <div class="flex flex-col">
      <!-- Author strip -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3.5 pb-7 border-b border-line-soft mb-8 col-[1/-1]">
        <img src={profilePic.src} alt="Rasheed Bustamam" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover shrink-0" />
        <div>
          <div class="font-mono text-xs text-ink font-medium">Rasheed Bustamam</div>
          <div class="font-mono text-11 text-faint mt-0.5">software engineer · California</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Prose -->
      <div class="about-prose font-serif text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink">
        <p>
          I'm <strong>Rasheed Bustamam</strong>, a software engineer in California.
          <strong>Bustamam Technology</strong> is my one-person consulting practice.
        </p>

        <p>
          I've been building for the web since 2015, when I started on the front end at
          CoNarrative. In 2018 I was one of four people at LayerOne when XYO bought it. I led
          projects at FullStack Labs, then spent four years as the founding engineer at Edvo,
          where I built the web app, the browser extension and the desktop app. In 2021 I joined
          Salty right before CDK Global acquired it. I stayed, got promoted to Staff Engineer, and
          ran a team of three automation engineers. I'm back with that team now at Salty.ai.
        </p>

        <p>
          I work there full time, so I only take on a few startups at a time, for a few hours a
          week each. Sometimes that's as a part-time founding engineer, sometimes as an advisor,
          and sometimes to build one specific thing.
        </p>

        <p>
          I write here about systems design, and about checking whether AI tools do what they
          claim. If I got something wrong, tell me.
        </p>

        <p>
          To talk about an engagement, reach out via <a href="mailto:admin@bustamam.tech">email</a> or
          through the <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-prose {
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .about-prose p {
    margin: 0 0 22px;
  }

  .about-prose p:first-of-type::first-letter {
    float: left;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 64px;
    line-height: .85;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 6px 10px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .about-prose strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .about-prose a {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
</style>
